    "q-81404": {
      "dom_id": "step-q81404",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$11$ is **not** a prime number, or $15$ is **not** divisible by $5.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:11\\text{ is a prime number}$\n\n- $Q:15\\text{ is divisible by }5$",
      "worked_solution": "The sentence\n\n$11$ is **not** a prime number \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬P.$ \n\nThe sentence\n\n$15$ is **not** divisible by $5$ \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬Q.$\n\nTherefore, the sentence\n\n$11$ is **not** a prime number, or $15$ is **not** divisible by $5$\n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬P∨¬Q.$",
