    "q-176861": {
      "dom_id": "step-q176861",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "$\\pi $ is **not** a rational or negative number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:\\pi \\text{ is a rational number}$\n\n- $Q:\\pi \\text{ is a negative number}$",
      "worked_solution": "The given sentence is the negation of the following sentence: \n\n$\\pi $ is a rational or negative number, \n\nwhich can be expressed symbolically as $P∨Q.$\n\nThe negation is represented by the symbol \"$¬$\".  \n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as $¬(P∨Q).$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-176861-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "P∨¬Q",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"45\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>Q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> "
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-176861-b",
